    "body": "Correction: Lexer-Lux/Lexeditor#209 is not fixed. Disabling UWO restored shops in the earlier 5A8D build, but the later development builds made the same failure return: shop icons disappear near stores, minimap icons are absent, and shopkeepers have no shop interaction. That disproves the closed-state conclusion. The issue is reopened as actionable; I will not treat either UWO or development mode as the cause without reproducing the working-to-broken artifact difference.",
